        "content": "WF5 — Authenticated read webhooks: GET /leads, /lead?id=UUID, /jobs, /artifact?id=UUID, /knowledge/documents. Header Auth is required on all routes. Artifact route returns metadata only; controlled file bytes are not implemented. Rebind Postgres and Header Auth credentials after import. The dashboard proxies reads through its server and never sends the n8n key to the browser.",
